      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "LUXURY WATERCOLOR CAMP DISTRICT HOME | SLEEPS 12 | PRIVATE HEATED POOL + SPA | BEACH CLUB ACCESS | 6-SEAT GOLF CART | 30A<br>This 5 bedroom, 4.5 bath WaterColor vacation rental in the Camp District sleeps 12 and features a private heated pool, elevated spa, outdoor fireplace, full summer kitchen, and 6 passenger golf cart. Located just a three minute walk to Camp WaterColor and a five minute bike ride to the WaterColor Beach Club and Seaside, this home offers one of the most desirable locations in WaterColor on 30A.<br><br>If you are looking for a WaterColor rental with a private pool, Beach Club access, and space for large families, this is it.<br><br>LOCATION – CAMP DISTRICT WATERCOLOR<br>The Camp District is one of the most sought after areas in WaterColor.<br><br>- Three minute walk to Camp WaterColor lazy river, pools, and playground.<br>- Five minute bike ride to the WaterColor Beach Club.<br>- Five minute bike ride to Seaside dining and shopping.<br>- Easy access to the beach.<br>- Quiet residential setting away from heavy traffic.<br><br>You can park your car and experience WaterColor and 30A the way it was designed to be enjoyed.<br><br>PRIVATE COURTYARD POOL + OUTDOOR LIVING<br>Private pools in WaterColor are limited, and this home offers a true courtyard retreat.<br><br>- Heated pool with complimentary heating October 1 through May 1.<br>- Elevated spa.<br>- Covered outdoor living room with fireplace and mounted TV.<br>- Full outdoor kitchen with gas grill, Green Egg, pizza oven, and beverage refrigerator.<br>- Outdoor shower.<br><br>Morning coffee by the pool. Beach in the afternoon. Spa and fireplace at night. It feels like a private resort inside WaterColor.<br><br>INTERIOR DESIGN AND LAYOUT<br>Soaring ceilings, wide plank wood floors, detailed millwork, and walls of windows fill the home with natural light. The open concept design keeps everyone connected while still offering room to spread out.<br><br>The chef's kitchen features an oversized marble island with seating for six, professional grade appliances, custom cabinetry, and generous prep space. The living room offers comfortable seating and a fireplace, making it ideal for gathering after a full day at the Beach Club or beach.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>FIRST FLOOR<br>Kitchen.<br>Living room.<br>Half bath.<br>Laundry room.<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>Primary Suite – King bed, private balcony, soaking tub, large walk in shower.<br>Guest Suite – King bed with private bath.<br>Guest Suite – King bed with private bath.<br>Shared sitting area with coffee bar.<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>Guest Bedroom – Queen bed with private bath.<br>Bunk Room – Two twin over twin bunks sleeping four.<br>Lounge Area – Daybed with trundle sleeping two.<br>Shared bath with walk in shower.<br>Wet bar with wine fridge and microwave.<br><br>WHAT IS INCLUDED<br>- Up to 12 WaterColor Beach Club and community pool passes.<br>- 6 passenger golf cart.<br>- 6 adult bikes.<br>- Private heated pool and spa.<br>- Outdoor fireplace and summer kitchen.<br>- Sonos sound system.<br>- Parking for two vehicles.<br><br>THE WATERCOLOR 30A EXPERIENCE<br>This Camp District WaterColor vacation rental allows you to move easily between Camp WaterColor, the WaterColor Beach Club, Seaside, and the beaches of 30A.<br><br>Lazy river mornings. Beach Club afternoons. Bike rides to Seaside at sunset. Evenings in your private courtyard spa.<br><br>For guests searching for a WaterColor rental with a private pool, golf cart included, Beach Club access, and prime Camp District location, this home delivers.<br><br>If you want the full WaterColor experience on 30A, this one checks every box.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
